  <div class="g3"><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 01</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Crawl the store like Google does</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We map every page Google can reach, and every one it can’t, with the reason for each.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 02</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Rank issues by revenue impact</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">Each problem gets a rough effort estimate and the traffic and sales it likely affects. The list is sorted by that.</p></div><div class="card reveal" style="min-height:240px"><p class="label" style="margin:0 0 14px">Step 03</p><h3 class="disp" style="font-size:28px;margin:0 0 12px">Fix the top of the list and recheck</h3><p class="p" style="font-size:15px">We ship the most important fixes, then verify them. Anything that didn’t work gets reopened.</p></div></div>
